{"id":"152e2876adca3eca","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-inner3-covering-property.md","title":"ZFC Inner3 Covering Property","display":"df-zfc-inner3-covering-property — ZFC Inner3 Covering Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner3-covering-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner3-covering-property"],"display":"df-zfc-inner3-covering-property — ZFC Inner3 Covering Property","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner3-covering-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner3-covering-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner3-covering-property — ZFC Inner3 Covering Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(M,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3CoveringProperty}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3CoveringProperty}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}covering\\text{-}property} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3CoveringProperty}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall\\xi\\in X\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi))\\land\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(X\\approx\\alpha)\n\\to \\exists Y\\in M\\;\\bigl(\nX\\subseteq Y\\land\\forall\\xi\\in Y\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi)\\land\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;(Y\\approx\\beta)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}covering\\text{-}property} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3CoveringProperty}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall\\xi\\in X\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi))\\land\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(X\\approx\\alpha)\n\\to \\exists Y\\in M\\;\\bigl(\nX\\subseteq Y\\land\\forall\\xi\\in Y\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi)\\land\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;(Y\\approx\\beta)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cardinal bounds are expanded by equinumerosity with an ordinal below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, avoiding an untyped cardinality operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496